@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = paste-admin-or-staff-token-here
@customerToken = paste-customer-token-here
# Get tokens from AUTH-02 (POST /auth/login).
# Reports (RPT-*): admin@brightloop.test / Admin@12345 or staff@brightloop.test / Staff@12345 (customer -> 403).
# Portal (PORTAL-01): customer@brightloop.test / Customer@12345 (admin/staff -> 403).
# Report responses are cached for 60 seconds per parameter set.
### RPT-01 Summary (A,S) - date_from/date_to optional (default current month), date_from <= date_to else 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/summary?date_from=2026-10-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### RPT-02 Revenue trend (A,S) - interval day|week|month (default month); one row per period, ascending, no gaps
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/revenue-trend?date_from=2026-05-01&date_to=2026-10-31&interval=month
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### RPT-03 Overdue aging (A,S, P1) - confirmed invoices past due, buckets 1-30, 31-60, 61-90, 90+
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/overdue-aging
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### PORTAL-01 Customer summary (C) - own figures only; recent_invoices = last 5, no drafts
GET {{baseUrl}}/portal/summary
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
